    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>UV rays</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Diagnostic tool in medicine</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>-rays</td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Water purification</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Microwave</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Communication, Radar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Infrared wave</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>Improving visibility in foggy days</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
